OL,3,GNEWSABereavement tree unveiled at Hull 
OL,4,AMinster                                
OL,6,FA Christmas tree, dedicated to children
OL,7,Fand young people experiencing          
OL,8,Fbereavement over the festive season,   
OL,9,Fhas been put up outside Hull Minster.  
OL,11,FHull City Council and Hull Child       
OL,12,FBereavement Advisory Group said it was 
OL,13,Fa space of remembrance and a place for 
OL,14,Fpeople to pause, reflect and celebrate 
OL,15,Fthose they love.                       
OL,17,FJane Jones, who lost her husband seven 
OL,18,Fyears ago when her children were aged  
OL,19,Fnine and 13 years old said: "It's not  
OL,20,Fsomething that anyone wants to go      
OL,21,Fthrough and it's particularly difficult
OL,22,Ffor children.                          
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
